      "id": "sleep_nudge_001_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "うん。寝よう。これはかなり賛成。",
      "translatedText": "Mm. Sleep. I am very much in favor of this.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": { "expression": "gentle", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "sleep_nudge_001_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "sleep_nudge_001_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "夜のあなたは、明日のあなたに借金を作りがちだから。",
      "translatedText": "Night-you tends to create debt for tomorrow-you.",
      "emotion": "thinking",
      "presentation": { "expression": "thinking", "pose": "glasses_adjust", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "sleep_nudge_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "sleep_nudge_001_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "閉じるものを三つ。画面、作業、今日の反省会。",
      "translatedText": "Close three things: the screen, the work, and tonight's review meeting with yourself.",
      "emotion": "firm_gentle",
      "presentation": { "expression": "gentle", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "sleep_nudge_001_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "sleep_nudge_001_04",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "最後のやつが一番しつこいけど、明日に回していい。",
      "translatedText": "The last one is the most stubborn, but you can move it to tomorrow.",
      "emotion": "soft",
      "presentation": { "expression": "soft", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "sleep_nudge_001_05"
    },
    {
      "id": "sleep_nudge_001_05",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "私はここで栞を挟んでおく。続きは、朝のあなたに渡そう。",
      "translatedText": "I will place a bookmark here. Let us hand the rest to morning-you.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": { "expression": "warm", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "end"
